{"v":4,"catch":"沉浸式恐怖入侵遊戲","desc":"《Christmas Mutilator（聖誕殘害者）》這款驚險刺激的匿蹤恐怖遊戲，靈感來自八〇年代砍殺電影的粗獷氛圍與扣人心弦的懸念，故事發生在白雪皚皚、寒冷且孤寂的偏遠山間小屋。\n\n玩家將扮演「艾蜜莉亞」，一位慈愛的母親與妻子，她與丈夫亞當和孩子們一起來到這座人煙罕至的山中小屋慶祝聖誕節。艾蜜莉亞能否逃脫在小屋中徘徊的兇殘殺手，並成功生存下來呢？","publisher":"COSEN","release":"2025-12-25","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","法文","西班牙文","德文","義大利文","葡萄牙文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"限制級","size":"Switch 2 3.8GB / Switch 3.8GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/492186aca59da8ad0cb2de1e5495620322c2b0d3cbe275b8e6d3132be4937ae2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0fcb775cfc2c6c59be6f919e292503e018d560977b94fe485613843fc214628b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0cc90a708ee9528badb57ad67bcfdab975f08119fd27d0ac193caa26c9dc1fd4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/871a59b1ad8d69358c89fc42da42ad299dcce3d950fd536dadd5d8b1433f0720.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/540427d9c9729f143998a6b818d2692f517432bd66c0d0c9606c902008e5dca0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/72ad0e6639ef859e3b06d524918a4b1b0b0d397bbd209ac5675074e9dad9aa81.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c34026568000","dlc":[]}